ouble talking to women due to his lack of contact with the opposite sex in his childhood outside of those much older than himself. In addition, he has difficulty with simply having fun and enjoying himself in areas not involved with work."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87618"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"公儀隠密の時代から続く国防を司る諜報機関の一族の生まれ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼いころから国を守る忍者になるべく修行の日々を送っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間を騒がせる事件の解決のために学生という身分を活用し冬華学園に転入を命じられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同年代の女の子と接する機会が皆無だったため、女性と会話するときは内心ドキドキしてしまう"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22181","sourceWorkId":"29026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"公儀隠密の時代から続く国防を司る"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"諜報機関の一族の生まれ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼いころから国を守る忍者になるべく"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"修行の日々を送っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間を騒がせる事件の解決のために"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生という身分を活用し"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冬華学園に転入を命じられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同年代の女の子と接する機会が皆無だったため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性と会話するときは内心ドキドキしてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74079"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca622a4ed82d1b673bf7662902d303fe860249017d96fe30316203c9e51f9eae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/938f03fb400db5043cefe380beab473eaab3ccaa66fbe81740be3022bf0de692.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c87619","characterName":"カノン・メイフィールド","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74075","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"295925"},{"characterId":"74075","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"319941"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22177"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87619"},"originalCharacterName":"カノン・メイフィールド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A foreign student from overseas."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Able to treat all people fairly no matter who they may be."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has a straightforward personality and is often relied upon by those around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, when it comes to tales of ninjas, she becomes so enthusiastic that she almost seems like a different person entirely. She wants to becomes a ninja herself, and practices her ninja skills at the shrine near her school."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87619"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"海外からの留学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんな相手とも分け隔てなく接する事ができるフランクな性格で周りから頼りにされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし忍者の話題になると人が変わったようにテンションが上がる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身も忍者になりたいと思い、学園の近くの神社で忍者になるための修行をしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22177","sourceWorkId":"29026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"海外からの留学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんな相手とも分け隔てなく接する事ができる"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"フランクな性格で周りから頼りにされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし忍者の話題になると"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人が変わったようにテンションが上がる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身も忍者になりたいと思い、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の近くの神社で忍者になるための"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"修行をしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74075"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36bbde8aa535b63cd1d5b45a969ed3e14cbbec56e795f412368621c59593b08f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34619e401b7685db7b62bb0c9293374ddc4c7f850fa52c45e0908b3c40945245.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さいとうよしえ","creatorId":"vndb:s1545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1545","name":"さいとう よしえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:295925:74075:20696:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87620","characterName":"ヴァイス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74076","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"295925"},{"characterId":"74076","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"319942"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22178"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87620"},"originalCharacterName":"ヴァイス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of an old and strict Japanese family. She is extremely self-disciplined and tends to take a neutral stance or that of a moderator in terms of the knighthood's internal conflicts. She won the previous year's Festival and as a result gained the title of Weiss. She wields a standard straight sword in combat, and her style is focused on countering her opponent's moves. She hates lies and liars."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87620"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々続く名家の跡取りとして生まれ、自分に厳しくルールを遵守する騎士を体現している少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"去年一年生ながら騎士に選出されるとそのままMVPになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二つ名の「ヴァイス」と呼ばれ学園内では羨望の対象として一目置かれている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22178","sourceWorkId":"29026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々続く名家の跡取りとして生まれ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分に厳しくルールを遵守する"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"騎士を体現している少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"去年一年生ながら騎士に選出されると"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのままMVPになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二つ名の「ヴァイス」と呼ばれ学園内では"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"羨望の対象として一目置かれている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74076"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3eb210d166714de8af11f8ceac0b76c633be08d080e91078851fb307aba6d890.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad2ee1bfb325c9f0097cb71b3a42d38ce6dd9236f2d7ca2757ba48b9ea35ebd5.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:295925:74076:4956:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87621","characterName":"蓮城寺 舞","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74077","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"295925"},{"characterId":"74077","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"319943"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22179"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87621"},"originalCharacterName":"蓮城寺 舞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of a family that once led one of the pre-war 'zaibatsu' mega-corporations of Japan. She is currently the Captain of the Knights, and she wields a parrying dagger and rapier in matches. She is an effective leader, but her sense of humor and tendency to persistently try to recruit people she thinks will be useful to the knighthood can be off-putting. She is the head of the faction in the knighthood focused on reforming the system, which in the past has had a tendency toward corruption."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87621"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本有数の財閥の娘にして、見る人を引き付ける魅力を持つカリスマ騎士団長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柔らかな物腰で人当たりと面倒見がいいお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力も高く学内では憧れの存在でファンも多い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22179","sourceWorkId":"29026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本有数の財閥の娘にして、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見る人を引き付ける魅力を持つ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カリスマ騎士団長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柔らかな物腰で人当たりと"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒見がいいお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力も高く学内では"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"憧れの存在でファンも多い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74077"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bdb40ba8fa150966af74a9f22c1041bd06db8c452e53063f5d840f4d309bc4ff.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db04c87032f88c0542cbcd1f8bc60280447bd0b00faeb38d358b3d7c93f43306.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡嶋妙","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:295925:74077:4646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87622","characterName":"雨ノ森 ゆい","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74078","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"295925"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22180"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87622"},"originalCharacterName":"雨ノ森 ゆい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Twin sister to Rise, a first year with a talent for coding who seeks to enter the research institute part of the Academic City on her own merits. A serious girl who is, herself, a prodigy, she nonetheless has an inferiority complex toward her older sister, who is an outright genius. She is somewhat socially awkward, not the least of which because she has spent most of her life devoting herself to her studies, but she is kind enough to be willing to help if someone really needs it and asks openly and honestly."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87622"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い顔立ちながらもしっかり者で、物怖じしない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相手が誰であろうと自分の意思をはっきりと表明できる気質の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プログラミング管理が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"りせという上級院へ飛び級した双子の姉がいる"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22180","sourceWorkId":"29026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い顔立ちながらもしっかり者で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物怖じしない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相手が誰であろうと"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の意思をはっきりと表明できる"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気質の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プログラミング管理が得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"りせという上級院へ飛び級した双子の姉がいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74078"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/adb745fce37f32c8629a1ade2b9e0102d0959f237dbb2387bae60ce87521edfe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10e2542c2896648f7c14aa9a194278827547d028680f73b7846922675e7d2fb5.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石原舞","creatorId":"vndb:s985","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s985","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s985","name":"石原 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:295925:74078:13372:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87623","characterName":"モモカ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74080","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"295925"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22182"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87623"},"originalCharacterName":"モモカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an AI that resides in the Jin's device that charges in navigating and hacking."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is given a pseudo-personality and and is capable of expressing emotions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The way she speaks is pale and plainly, but its sarcasm and other human-like qualities are evident throughout appear everywhere."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87623"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"迅のデバイスに常駐しているＡＩ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ナビゲートやハッキングなどを担当してくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"疑似人格を与えられており、感情を表現することができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"話し方は淡白だが皮肉を口にしたりと人間っぽさが随所に現れたりする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22182","sourceWorkId":"29026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"迅のデバイスに常駐しているＡＩ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ナビゲートやハッキングなどを担当してくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"疑似人格を与えられており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情を表現することができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"話し方は淡白だが皮肉を口にしたりと"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間っぽさが随所に現れたりする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74080"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e048843f98c5130dcce053c45cbc9d22df05bcf710b38755f397db47f81386c2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a57b653ee28c1346f56f13d30e51066bc0309b6b1d6b8fccb6989238f1fe5bd5.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:295925:74080:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87624","characterName":"雨ノ森 りせ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74081","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"295925"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22183"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87624"},"originalCharacterName":"雨ノ森 りせ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a genius in the fields of programming and AI at very young age that invited to Senrai Academy City Senior High School."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A typical researcher who moves with curiosity and does not care about anything other than what she is interested in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves her younger twin sister, Yui, but she is feeling lonely because she has recently been distancing herself from her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87624"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼いことから神童と呼ばれ、閃来学園都市上級院に招かれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プログラミング、ＡＩ分野の天才。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が興味をもったこと以外頓着しない、好奇心のまま動く典型的な研究者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹のゆいの事が大好きだが、最近距離を置かれていることに寂しさを覚えている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22183","sourceWorkId":"29026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼いことから神童と呼ばれ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"閃来学園都市上級院に招かれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プログラミング、ＡＩ分野の天才。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が興味をもったこと以外頓着しない、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心のまま動く典型的な研究者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹のゆいの事が大好きだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近距離を置かれていることに"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寂しさを覚えている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74081"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec37925ca7ac18e8f7e9d8c007c2fe1313abd2083875223ec51926d859b88367.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/5787ca03ee63a22b9281e8128ab7f4fd317551bdbb91eb3f70c79dacd168f8db.webp","width":118,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桐村まり","creatorId":"vndb:s1549","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1549","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1549","name":"桐村 まり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-